---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { route } from '../i18n/routes';
import { breadcrumbSchema } from '../lib/seo';
const lang = 'en';
---
<PageLayout title="Cookies on PlantCare101: None Set, and How We Would Tell You" description="Cookies on PlantCare101: the site and its plant calculators set no cookie, use no analytics or advertising tracker, and this page will list any change before it happens." lang={lang} noindex={true} jsonLd={[breadcrumbSchema([{ name: 'Home', path: '/' }, { name: 'Cookies', path: route('cookies', lang) }])]} breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Cookies' }]}>
  <header class="mb-6"><h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-navy-900 md:text-4xl">Cookies</h1></header>
  <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none">
    <p>PlantCare101 sets no cookie. The tools keep your inputs only in the page itself, and in the address bar when you use the share link of the watering calculator. No audience measurement, advertising or social media script is loaded.</p>
    <p>If we add audience measurement or advertising later, this page will list each cookie, its purpose and its lifetime before it is set, and the <a href={route('privacy', lang)}>privacy policy</a> will explain how to refuse it.</p>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
